    <compactLayoutAssignment>SYSTEM</compactLayoutAssignment>
    <deploymentStatus>Deployed</deploymentStatus>
    <description>One record per link between two CFO Bot skills (Chatbot Instruction records): whenever the Skill (Instruction__c, the master record) is loaded into a conversation, the CFO Bot proxy also loads the Required Skill (Required_Instruction__c). Admins add links on a skill&apos;s Required Skills related list; the proxy reads them with the instructions every 10 minutes. Rules: only an active skill the router can choose can be required (not Always Include or Proxy Injected); a skill can&apos;t require itself or a position-restricted skill; a required skill can&apos;t be deleted while a link points to it; deleting a skill deletes its own links. Each skill&apos;s Required Skills text field (Required_Skill_Names__c) lists these links by name, kept up to date by Apex. Replaces the older single-link Instruction Dependency lookup (Chatbot_Instruction__c.Instruction_Dependency__c), which no record uses any more. Configuration, not business data: 10 links, created Oct 2026.</description>
